Depends: libgtk-3-0, libblkid1, liblzma5, libstdc++6
Description: Local-first Markdown prompt manager (Preview)
 PromptBox stores prompts in a searchable daily timeline with Markdown,
 tags, outlines, local backups, code blocks, and LaTeX formulas.
